# The framework UI is on GitHub Packages, which asks for a token even for a public package. pnpm ignores a token
# in a project .npmrc, so the token is set where pnpm trusts it: ~/.npmrc, by a developer (docs/getting-started.md),
# and by CI and the image build from PACKAGES_TOKEN (docs/deployment.md).
@trislabcompany:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
